    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "You may not be able to tell at first glance, but Lungmen's been through a lot lately."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "Sauin candles aren't bright enough to light up all the dark corners of this city, and those kids don't exactly have it easy."
